Revision history for App-Saisons

0.2.1  2026-10-22
    - Fix: reading Gemini sessions no longer dies on Windows, where
      POSIX::tzset is unimplemented.
    - Fix: no HOME warnings on Windows when the modules are loaded
      directly, not just through the saisons command.

0.2.0  2026-10-22
    - New: running-session markers refresh by themselves every few
      seconds; r still forces it.
    - New: the list redraws itself on terminal resize; Ctrl+L forces a
      full repaint.
    - New: inline sort mode — press s, pick the column with left/right and
      the direction with up/down; S flips direction directly.
    - New: t cycles grouping: flat, by path, by agent.
    - New: arrows browse the live results while typing a search; ENTER
      keeps the highlighted session selected.
    - New: Alt+C (or TAB) toggles case-sensitive matching in filter and
      search.
    - Fix: full-text search no longer rescans on every keypress; typing is
      debounced and extending the query searches only the previous hits.
    - Fix: ENTER, delete and move act only on selections visible under the
      active filter, not on ones a filter hides.
    - New: selection bars in muted blue and teal that keep the column
      colors readable.
    - New: --version and the banner show which build is running.
    - New: SAISONS_LAUNCHER overrides where sessions open (the old name
      CLAUDE_SESSIONS_LAUNCHER still works).
    - Fix: no warnings on Windows; paths resolve via USERPROFILE.
    - Fix: quits cleanly when stdin closes instead of spinning.

0.1.0  2026-06-03
    - First release.
